  "comment": [
    "The exact cloud images every disposable guest in this project boots from.",
    "The builder guest runs as root, installs build dependencies, receives the",
    "project source and the pinned generator, and produces the images a release",
    "is cut from: it is part of the supply chain, so it may not boot whatever",
    "'latest' happened to publish today.",
    "Each entry names one immutable Debian build directory and the digest this",
    "project measured for that file. The digest in this file is the authority.",
    "Debian's own SHA512SUMS is recorded for provenance, not as the check: a",
    "verifier that fetches its expectation from the same place as the artefact",
    "proves only that the two arrived together.",
    "scripts/appliance-guest-base-image.sh downloads to .part, verifies, renames",
    "atomically, and re-hashes a cached image before every boot. A role without",
    "an entry, or a missing digest, is a failure and never a skipped check."
  ],
